See http://www.steelypips.org/nethack/medusa.html for tips on how to face 
the various particular challenges the Medusa level presents.

As for hit points, a Samurai starts with 13 hit points, and gains 1d8 per 
level to level 11 - an average of 4.5 - then 1 hit point per level. Being 
human gives you +2 hit points per level. You don't state your constitution 
but a Samurai usually starts with 17 or 18 giving +2 to +3 each time you 
gain a level. Assuming +2 I think that your average hit points would be:

(13 + 2) + (10 x (4.5 + 2 + 2)) + (1 * (1 + 2 + 2))

which is an average of 105. An 18 Con samurai could expect 116. So either 
you've lost maximum hit points (fpebyy bs sver be sver genc IIRC), or 
you've been mildly lucky.

